 sea with Joran Yara and Theon zip  actually sent me a photo from Google  Maps and it gives a really good look at  the entire area so you can get a good  feel for this location you can see how  close the castle at Riverrun is to the  actual new green screen and you can see  where the Lannisters had set up their  camp before  when Jaime and Bronn were here to meet  with the Freys and the blackfish but  just like everything else I reported on  today I don't want to speculate too much  because there just isn't enough evidence  yet to say what they're gonna be filming  here but I can confirm this area was  used for Riverrun Casterly Rock Inn they  filmed the sea battle here on the lot so  if you want to take a guess at what  they're gonna be doing here that's a  good place to start as soon as I find  out any more information I will let you  all know right away so let me know what  you think about everything down below if  you have any interesting theories on the  photos I've shown throughout this video  please leave it in the comments because  I'd love to hear it I want to thank Zipp  once again for sending me those photos  and I want to thank all of you for  stopping by and checking out the video I  really appreciate your support during  this long night into the off season I  also want to thank everyone who supports  this channel on patreon because without  your help this wouldn't be possible so  thank you all very much I hope you all  have a great day I'll see you in the  next one bye  [Music]  [Music]  you


